flowchart TB
    subgraph Offline[Offline training and validation]
        Trace[Seeded randomized request traces] --> Env[Gymnasium event simulator]
        Env --> PPO[PPO actor and value training]
        PPO --> V[Separate validation scenarios]
        V --> Best[Best checkpoint]
        Best --> Export[Numeric actor export and checked metadata]
    end
    subgraph Live[Live gateway - one process]
        Clients[Registered API clients] --> Admission[Atomic Redis admission]
        Admission --> Backend[Bounded HTTP backend]
        Backend --> Telemetry[Completed-request telemetry]
        Clients --> Demand[Offered-demand counters]
        Demand --> Features[Shared normalized features]
        Telemetry --> Features
        Features --> Actor[Deterministic actor once per interval]
        Export --> Actor
        Actor --> Guards[Bounds and optional health safety]
        AIMD[Preserved EWMA / AIMD fallback] --> Guards
        Guards --> Publication[Atomic old-rate settlement and publication]
        Publication --> Admission
        Guards --> Logs[Decision logs and Prometheus]
    end
    Logs --> Reports[Independent HTTP and simulator reports]
